iversity VP privatized her  Twitter feed after reportedly receiving  a slew of racist and sexist insults  Google is in a very unusual position  right now you when you have a polarized  workforce and you're talking about  fracturing communication even  I'm sure they're really concerned that  this won't be resolved Pichai is now  reviewing emails from an employee city  actually says the vast majority of them  support his fired up de Bourgh but  others voice concerns about being able  to speak freely at work Google now says  it plans to hold group forums for  employees to discuss their concerns Jeff  Carter thank you
 

